your binoculars!

00:06:34.327 --> 00:06:38.130 line:0%
-You tricked me.

00:06:38.130 --> 00:06:42.301 line:0%
You're a good spy
and I'm a bad spy.

00:06:42.301 --> 00:06:46.805 line:0%
-You're right. I'm the best
and you're the worst.

00:06:46.805 --> 00:06:49.641 line:0%
-Uh-oh. The bad guys are here!

00:06:49.641 --> 00:06:51.477 line:0%
We have to fight them now!

00:06:51.477 --> 00:06:53.946 line:0%
-But we're both
terrible fighters!

00:06:53.946 --> 00:06:55.748 line:0%
-Quick, throw the binoculars
at them!

00:06:55.748 --> 00:06:58.116 line:0%
-Spy 2 throws the binoculars
at the bad guy

00:06:58.116 --> 00:06:59.552 line:0%
and hits him in the face.

00:06:59.552 --> 00:07:00.887 line:0%
The bad guy falls.

00:07:00.887 --> 00:07:03.155 line:0%
Spy 1 puts his arm around Spy 2.

00:07:03.155 --> 00:07:05.824 line:0%
-We did it!

00:07:05.824 --> 00:07:08.160 line:0%
We saved the world.

00:07:08.160 --> 00:07:11.264 line:0%
Let's go get lunch
and talk about our friendship.

00:07:11.264 --> 00:07:13.165 line:0%
-And scene.

00:07:13.165 --> 00:07:17.169 line:0%
[ Cheers and applause ]
Fantastic.

00:07:17.169 --> 00:07:19.571
That's what I call acting chops.
-That goes away.

00:07:19.571 --> 00:07:21.473
-That's the one.
That's the one right there.

00:07:21.473 --> 00:07:22.574
Tom Hanks!

00:07:22.574 --> 00:07:24.376 line:0%
I want to test you a little bit,
you know?

00:07:24.376 --> 00:07:26.512 line:0%
I want to see what you got.
-Alright.

00:07:26.512 --> 00:07:27.846 line:0%
