your performance is.

00:07:34.787 --> 00:07:37.823
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:07:37.823 --> 00:07:40.092
Does that sound --

00:07:40.092 --> 00:07:41.761
Does that sound cool?

00:07:41.761 --> 00:07:44.129
-So you're kind of --
you want to test me.

00:07:44.129 --> 00:07:46.599
-Yeah. Yeah, is that cool?

00:07:46.599 --> 00:07:48.701
-I ain't afraid of you, bitch,
so...

00:07:48.701 --> 00:07:50.669
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:07:50.669 --> 00:07:54.040
-It's a fun game.

00:07:54.040 --> 00:07:56.008
We're playing a fun game
together.

00:07:56.008 --> 00:07:58.010
-Okay.
-Yeah. Here's the catch.

00:07:58.010 --> 00:08:02.548
The scenes that you'll be
reading are not

00:08:02.548 --> 00:08:04.650
