the baseball hitter.

00:08:50.296 --> 00:08:52.398
-Oh, okay.
-The baseball hitter.

00:08:52.398 --> 00:08:53.799
-This is from Connor.
-Yes.

00:08:53.799 --> 00:08:56.502
Higgins will read our scene
directions, descriptions for us.

00:08:56.502 --> 00:08:59.138
Higgins, please set the scene.

00:08:59.138 --> 00:09:02.541 line:0%
-This story takes place
on a baseball field.

00:09:02.541 --> 00:09:08.947 line:0%
The best baseball team is losing
and the best hitter needs help.

00:09:08.947 --> 00:09:11.183 line:0%
