Beak.

00:10:13.612 --> 00:10:17.183 line:0%
[ Laughter ]

00:10:17.183 --> 00:10:20.719 line:0%
-Wow!
I'm gonna hit a home run now.

00:10:20.719 --> 00:10:22.821 line:0%
Thank you, Mr. Bird!

00:10:22.821 --> 00:10:26.925 line:0%
-No problem. If you have wings,
