00:11:28.521 --> 00:11:30.488 line:0%
I always believed in you,
Birdman.

00:11:30.488 --> 00:11:34.125 line:0%
I am your number-one fan.

00:11:34.125 --> 00:11:36.028 line:0%
-Caw! Caw! Caw!

00:11:36.028 --> 00:11:39.532 line:0%
